{"product_id":"feeding-kids-the-netmums-com-cookery-book-120-foolproof-family-recipes","title":"Feeding kids the Netmums.com Cookery Book: 120 Foolproof Family Recipes","description":"\u003cp\u003eHow do we know that every mom will love these recipes? How do we know that children will want to eat them? Because the recipes come from members of netmums.com?the online community of 250,000 mothers from all over the UK?and all have been tried, tasted, and passed the three great tests. First, they are easy to prepare and cook, and don't cost too much. Secondly, they are nutritious and fit easily into a healthy diet. And third, they made the children who tried them happy. Plates were left clean and the dishes were asked for again. In response to the huge demand for information and advice on feeding children, here are 120 delicious recipes and hundreds of food tips from Netmums nationwide.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 165 x 241\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Netmums\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780755316045\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 224\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45820904472729,"sku":"17RC-59780755316045","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68f9f675e9f59_Feeding_kids_the_Netmums.com_Cookery_Book-_120_Foolproof_Family_Recipes_Netmums.jpg?v=1761234447","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/feeding-kids-the-netmums-com-cookery-book-120-foolproof-family-recipes","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}